	measure 'Executive Summary Net Sales LY YTD' = ```
			
			VAR LastDayAvailable = max('Date'[Date])+ if(max('Date'[Date])>=today(),WEEKDAY(today(), 1)-8,0)
			VAR LastDayLY=LOOKUPVALUE('Date EOY'[Date LY],'Date EOY'[Date],LastDayAvailable)
			VAR LY=CALCULATETABLE(SUMMARIZECOLUMNS('Date EOY'[Date LY], FILTER('Date EOY','Date EOY'[Year]=max('Date'[Year]))),ALLEXCEPT('Date EOY','Date EOY'[Select a Calendar]))
			Return
			CALCULATE (
			    [Net Retail Sales $],
			    ALLEXCEPT('Date EOY', 'Date EOY'[Select a Calendar]),
			    'Date EOY'[Date] in LY &&
			    'Date EOY'[Date]<=LastDayLY  
			)
			```
		formatString: 0
		displayFolder: Executive Dashboard\Sales\DTC
		lineageTag: f4c15cd1-b1e0-47e8-be7e-253667869f4e

