	measure 'Executive Summary Stock AUR LY' =
			
			switch(
			        selectedvalue('Headers - Executive Summary'[Business Unit]),
			        "Wholesale",
			            SWITCH(
			                SELECTEDVALUE('Headers - Executive Summary'[Period]),
			                "Week to Date",[Executive Summary Stock AUR Wholesale WTD LY],
			                "Month to Date",[Executive Summary Stock AUR Wholesale MTD LY],
			                "Year to Date",[Executive Summary Stock AUR Wholesale YTD LY]
			            ),
			        "DTC",
			            SWITCH(
			                SELECTEDVALUE('Headers - Executive Summary'[Period]),
			                "Week to Date",[Executive Summary Stock AUR DTC WTD LY],
			                "Month to Date",[Executive Summary Stock AUR DTC MTD LY],
			                "Year to Date",[Executive Summary Stock AUR DTC YTD LY]
			            ),
			        "Total Company",
			            SWITCH(
			                SELECTEDVALUE('Headers - Executive Summary'[Period]),
			                "Week to Date",[Executive Summary Stock AUR Total WTD LY],
			                "Month to Date",[Executive Summary Stock AUR Total MTD LY],
			                "Year to Date",[Executive Summary Stock AUR Total YTD LY]
